          "text": "Zero Emission Maritime Buyers Alliance – ZEMBA Skip to content Follow on LinkedIn info@shipzemba.org About How We Work ZEMBA 101 RFP 1 RFP 2 Beyond the Tenders FAQ The Latest Contact Us About How We Work ZEMBA 101 RFP 1 RFP 2 Beyond the Tenders FAQ The Latest Contact Us Subscribe Search Join ZEMBA About How We Work ZEMBA 101 RFP 1 RFP 2 Beyond the Tenders FAQ The Latest Contact Us About How We Work ZEMBA 101 RFP 1 RFP 2 Beyond the Tenders FAQ The Latest Contact Us Subscribe Search Join ZEMBA About How We Work ZEMBA 101 RFP 1 RFP 2 Beyond the Tenders FAQ The Latest Contact Us About How We Work ZEMBA 101 RFP 1 RFP 2 Beyond the Tenders FAQ The Latest Contact Us Join ZEMBA Join ZEMBA Join ZEMBA Kickstarting the market for maritime shipping's clean energy future The Zero Emission Maritime Buyers Alliance (ZEMBA) is a first-of-its-kind buyers group working to accelerate the most sustainable, scalable, and economically viable solutions for the maritime sector. Play Video The global maritime shipping industry is shifting to a future powered by clean energy. Ocean shipping is essential to our economy. 80-90% of cargo is shipped across the ocean. But as the global economy shifts to cleaner energy sources, the maritime sector is falling behind. Maritime infrastructure needs upgrading, market uncertainty is stifling needed investments, and 99% of vessels on the water today operate on high-emission fuels. Now is the time to future-proof this sector, which is the backbone of our global economy. To ensure a reliable, affordable, clean energy future in ocean transportation by 2050 at the latest, we need a rapid increase in innovation and a competitive market for new fuels and technologies. 80-90% of cargo is shipped across the ocean. 99% of vessels on the water today operate on high-emission fuels. Challenges Barriers to the development of a robust clean energy maritime market include: High initial projected cost of scalable, long-term solutions Lack of long-term committed offtake from carriers Scattered and short term freight buyer demand Slow development of infrastructure to effectively scale solutions Insufficient policy support to accelerate the transition The Solution ZEMBA is the Catalytic Solution The Zero Emission Maritime Buyers Alliance (ZEMBA) is working to bridge the classic “Valley of Death” that many new markets face between research &amp; development and robust commercial deployment. By collaborating to commit offtake and make advanced market commitments for innovative fuels and technologies, ZEMBA is kickstarting a new market and spurring investment in scalable, sustainable solutions to enable an economically viable transition. Learn More ZEMBA Members Trusted by 45+ of the world’s leading companies Facilitated by Co-founders Join ZEMBA Collective Procurement of Clean Energy-Powered Shipping Going it alone won’t amount to much. But collective action among freight buyers through ZEMBA is a proven pathway to help kickstart a strong and competitive clean energy market, credibly reduce your company’s Scope 3 emissions, and lower long-term costs of the clean energy transition by channeling investment toward the most scalable fuels and technologies. Join ZEMBA No Fees Join ZEMBA now with no membership fee. It’s an easy yes! The Latest Recent Updates Featured , Report/Blog/Statement ZEMBA&nbsp;is a&nbsp;2026&nbsp;Earthshot&nbsp;Prize Nominee&nbsp; March 19, 2026 ZEMBA is deeply honored to announce that it has been named a 2026 Earthshot Prize... Press Release ZEMBA Announces Winners of Highly Anticipated E-Fuel Tender December 17, 2025 Hapag-Lloyd and North Sea Container Line have won ZEMBA’s second tender, enabling ZEMBA’s members to... ZEMBA in the News As seen in Canary Media: Can cargo shipping stay the course toward cleaner fuels? October 22, 2025 Canary Media interviewed ZEMBA’s President and CEO Ingrid Irigoyen, following the International Maritime Organization (IMO)’s... View All Updates Stay up to date with ZEMBA announcements Subscribe Zero Emission Maritime Buyers Alliance About How We Work FAQ The Latest Contact Us Join ZEMBA About How We Work FAQ The Latest Contact Us Join ZEMBA About How We Work FAQ The Latest Contact Us Join ZEMBA About How We Work FAQ The Latest Contact Us Join ZEMBA ©2026 Zero Emission Maritime Buyers Alliance. All Rights Reserved. Privacy Policy"
