          "text": "[primary_deadline] Per Table 9708.2 as amended, the next two A/RCx compliance due dates not yet passed are December 1, 2026 (Building IDs ending in 0 or 1) and December 1, 2027 (Building IDs ending in 2 or 3).",
          "span": "The next A/RCx compliance due date for Building IDs ending in 0 or 1 is still December 1, 2026. • The next A/RCx compliance due date for Building IDs ending in 2 or 3 is still December 1, 2027."
        },
