uction Process Homeowners Guide For Homeowners For Homeowners’ Agents For Landlords Information about Zoning Apps LADBS Go (Mobile) ePlanLA (Online) PermitLA (Express Permit) Atlas (Map Viewer) LA County Service Locator NavigateLA ZIMAS (Zone Info Map Access System) Invoice Tracking System (IVTS) Services Forms &amp; Publications Our Organization ePlanLA will be unavailable beginning Friday 7/10 starting at 7:00 PM through Saturday at 10:00 AM. Read more Home Services Green Buildi... Existing Buildings Energy &amp; Water Efficiency Program Home Green Buildi... Existing Buildings Energy &amp; Water Efficiency Program EBEWE Program The Existing Buildings Energy &amp; Water Efficiency Program (EBEWE) Program was established through the addition of Division 97 to the Los Angeles Municipal Code (LAMC), effective 1/29/2017. &nbsp; EBEWE consists of two parts: 1) Benchmarking and 2) Audits and Retro-Commissioning (A/RCx) Ordinance &amp; Amendments Benchmarking Audits &amp; Retro-Commissioning General Information What's New & Alerts Find your Building ID Request Time Extension Energy & Water Efficiency Related Info & Programs Benchmarking Process and Information How to Comply with Benchmarking Register your Building for Benchmarking Benchmarking FAQs Building Compliance Status (Check your Building) LADWP Request Usage Data Page SoCalGas Request Usage Data Page Info on Energy Star Portfolio Manager Audits & Retro Commissioning (A/RCX) Process and Information A/RCx User Instruction Guides Start or Complete the A/RCx Compliance process A/RCx FAQs Building Compliance Status (Check your Building) Support Customer support is available online or by phone. Use the links on the right to get started. Footer yellow Frequently Asked Questions Glossary Contact Us CPRA Services Services Plan Review & Permitting Inspection Code Enforcement & Compliance Forms &amp; Publications Forms & Publications Forms Publications News & Announcements Our Organization Our Organization Our Locations Empl