          "text": "Low-Emission Ammonia Data (LEAD) - Ammonia Energy Association Low-Emission Ammonia Data (LEAD) - Ammonia Energy Association /* IE 9 and lower only */ /* END IE 9 and lower only */ skip to main content MENU LEAD Certification Pilot Registry Auditors Documents Articles Webinars Conferences 2026 Annual Conference Presentations Membership Register as an Industry Member AEA Membership Directory Sign up for our Newsletter Member Login About AEA Leadership AEA Staff Ammonia-Energy-Association-Logo-Horizontal-Color Search Ammonia-Energy-Association-Logo-Horizontal-Color LEAD Certification Pilot Registry Auditors Documents Articles Webinars Conferences 2026 Annual Conference Presentations Membership Register as an Industry Member AEA Membership Directory Sign up for our Newsletter Member Login About AEA Leadership AEA Staff Search Low-Emission Ammonia Data (LEAD) Plants | Vessels | Infrastructure The Ammonia Energy Association tracks the global implementation of low-emission ammonia projects across multiple sectors. While detailed data is held for our members, we also make information available to the public through this website, including interactive data sets, summaries, and infographics. These data and deliverables are updated quarterly, and include information about ammonia plants , ammonia-fueled maritime vessels , and ammonia infrastructure . As low-emission ammonia projects move from feasibility to fact, the dissemination of relevant, accessible, and transparent information – on both supply and demand – forms a key part of the AEA’s mission, to share knowledge, foster collaboration, develop key programs, and engage in advocacy with industry, policy-makers, and the public for the safe and sustainable adoption of low-emission ammonia. We hope you find this information useful – if so, you can return each quarter for updates. It is published under the Creative Commons Attribution, Non-Commercial, Share-Alike license , and you are welcome to share and adapt these materials in accordance with this license. The original data upon which this material is based is available at a reduced rate for Bronze AEA members and free to all other tiers as a benefit of membership . Public Release of LEAD Data Sets We are pleased to announce the public release of the the Low-Emission Ammonia Data (LEAD) product, making this trusted industry resource accessible beyond AEA membership. These datasets provide comprehensive, global analysis of clean ammonia project developments, offering unparalleled visibility into the evolving ammonia energy landscape. Each LEAD dataset is available to non-AEA members for $995 and is available for immediate download here . Plants | Vessels | Infrastructure Ammonia-Energy-Association-Logo-Horizontal-Color Ammonia Energy Association 44927 George Washington Blvd, Suite 265 Ashburn, VA 20147 USA Quick Links LEAD Certification Pilot Registry Auditors Documents Articles Webinars Conferences 2026 Annual Conference Presentations Membership Register as an Industry Member AEA Membership Directory Sign up for our Newsletter Member Login About AEA Leadership AEA Staff Copyright © 2026 Ammonia Energy Association. All Rights Reserved. Site designed and developed by Social Ink"
